{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>【Now新聞台】屯門有兩輛巴士相撞，九人受傷。</p><p>兩名巴士司機及其中一名乘客，分別由救護員陪同登上救護車。警方早上八時許接報，一輛九巴在屯門鳴琴路近山景邨對開，懷疑收掣不及撞向前面一輛切線的另一輛九巴。兩名巴士司機以及七名巴士乘客受傷，要送院治理。現場交通一度受阻。</p><p></p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T03:02:40.374639+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":132,"images":0,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T02:04:25+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T06:18:14.948477+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T02:58:04.059936+00:00","content_hash":"52907bff7c71da9597c4602d622b7b10abe1622b47960780bb1a89c903fb76a3","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}